  "prefLabel": "Plc 1902.05 Perinatal period",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1902.05 “Perinatal period” means the period that extends from conception through 12 months after the end of pregnancy, inclusive of all birth outcomes.\n\nSource. #14429, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1900.html"
